{"id":"nachher","lemma":"nachher","pos":"adv","rank":1246,"glosses":["in a short while (in the near future, but not more than a few hours)","afterwards, later (after something has finished)"],"ipa":"/ˈnaːxˌheːɐ̯/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e7/De-nachher.ogg/De-nachher.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich gebe es dir nachher.","en":"I'll give it to you later.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},null]},{"text":"Ruf mich nachher an.","en":"Give me a call later.","words":[{"g":"to call out","l":"rufen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null,{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Darf ich nachher anrufen?","en":"May I call later?","words":[{"g":"to be allowed","l":"dürfen"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to call, to ring"}]},{"text":"Ich erkläre dir die Sache nachher.","en":"I'll explain the matter to you later on.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to explain","l":"erklären"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"matter"},null]},{"text":"Ich komme nachher, um Sie zu treffen.","en":"I'll come and see you later.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},null,{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to meet"}]}]}